+| REQ-REPORT-5247 | Strict SLOT artifact schema and receipt normalizer | Scaffolding | `python/carnot/experiment_5247_slot_artifact_normalizer_v480.py`; `tests/python/test_experiment_5247_slot_artifact_normalizer_v480.py`; `openspec/capabilities/research-reporting/spec.md`; `results/experiment_5247_slot_artifact_normalizer_v480.json`; honest_verdict={"principle":"Must start with complete: or blocked_ and state whether the strict normalizer is ready for gated consumers.","value":"complete: strict artifact schema/receipt normalizer ready for gated consumers; safe repairs are shape-only and missing evidence remains blocked."}; status=<missing>; artifact_normalizer_ready=true; safe_repairs_supported=3; unsafe_repairs_rejected=7; no retro_* flags; no AUC/TP/FP/signed_improvement/violation_rate fields; mapped as blocked because the verdict contains `blocked`. |
+| SCENARIO-REPORT-5247-SAFE-REPAIR | Wrappers, nulls, and unambiguous gate fields normalize | Scaffolding | Artifact records only shape-only safe repairs: top-level principle wrapper unwrap, missing explicit null for declared nullable fields, and unambiguous boolean gate field extraction; no methodology, duration, model, solve, or win evidence is synthesized. |
+| SCENARIO-REPORT-5247-UNSAFE-REJECTION | Missing evidence does not become evidence | Scaffolding | Artifact rejects missing methodology receipts, missing duration receipts, subfloor compute duration, missing model receipts, missing or conflicting gate booleans, missing required-field principles, and solve/provenance/performance-win synthesis; the honest verdict says missing evidence remains blocked. |
+| SCENARIO-REPORT-5247-REPRESENTATIVE-479 | Representative artifacts stay quarantined when flagged | Scaffolding | Representative checks keep Exp 5235, Exp 5236, and Exp 5241 not ready for gates when source artifacts are flagged adversarial or have pending corrigenda; safe_repairs are empty and normalization_rejections preserve the quarantine reasons. |
